error[DZ0508]: `if` needs a `bool`, found `i32`
   ┌─ D:/OdinProjects/Dazzle/tests/workspace/typeerrors/src/errors.dz:51:8
   │
51 │     if n {
   │        ^ this is `i32`
   │
   = help: there is no truthiness in Dazzle — compare explicitly, e.g. `x != 0` or `p != null` (spec §10.1)

