error[DZ0510]: unused `!i32`
    ┌─ D:/OdinProjects/Dazzle/tests/workspace/typeerrors/src/errors.dz:143:5
    │
143 │     may_fail()
    │     ^^^^^^^^^^ this may fail, and the failure is discarded
